=========================================================
Files in this handout and their purpose:
=========================================================

help-CLK: main circuit file for testing the Four_Phase_Clock circuit
          When you completed the Four_Phase_Clock circuit, use:

		/home/cs355001/bin/cs355sim  help-CLK

	  to test your Four_Phase_Clock circuit.

help-MPC: main circuit file for testing the MPC_With_Reset circuit
          When you completed the MPC_With_Reset circuit, use:

                /home/cs355001/bin/cs355sim  help-MPC

          to test your MPC_With_Reset circuit.

clock.h:  This is your project file for pj4.
	  You will need to complete the

		Four_Phase_Clock circuit    and
		MPC_With_Reset   circuit

	  inside this file.

====================================================================

basic.h:  contains definition for  Full_Adder and  Decoder2x4
          It's included in help-CLK and help-MPC, so you use
	  the Full_Adder and Decoder2x4 circuits in your project.

sample-Dff:  Sample circuit file that shows you HOW to use 
	     EDiSim's Dff component

sample-mux:  Sample circuit file that shows you HOW to use 
	     EDiSim's Mux component


